### CampusRide rides-service · request collection
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" over each block.
### Start the service first (npm start). Expected status is written above each request.

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### 1. Health check  -> 200
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Login as Ana (driver)  -> 200 { accessToken, tokenType, expiresIn, user }
# @name loginAna
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@campusride.test", "password": "Driver123!" }

###
@anaToken = {{loginAna.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Login as Luis (student)  -> 200
# @name loginLuis
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "luis@campusride.test", "password": "Rider123!" }

###
@luisToken = {{loginLuis.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Login with wrong password  -> 401 "Invalid email or password"
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@campusride.test", "password": "wrong-password" }

### 5. Login with invalid body  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (email, password)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email" }

### 6. Malformed JSON  -> 400 INVALID_JSON (no stack trace)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":

### 7. Current user (protected)  -> 200 { user }
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{luisToken}}

### 8. List rides (public)  -> 200 [ ... ]
GET {{base}}/rides

### 9. List rides with seats available  -> 200 [ ... ]
GET {{base}}/rides?available=true&destination=campus

### 10. List rides with invalid filters  -> 400 (date, available)
GET {{base}}/rides?date=05-11-2026&available=maybe

### 11. Ride detail  -> 200
GET {{base}}/rides/1

### 12. Ride that does not exist  -> 404
GET {{base}}/rides/999

### 13. Invalid id  -> 400
GET {{base}}/rides/abc

### 14. Publish a ride WITHOUT token  -> 401 "Missing or malformed Authorization header"
POST {{base}}/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{ "origin": { "name": "Plaza de Armas", "lat": 20.5931, "lng": -100.3896 }, "destination": "Main campus", "departureTime": "2030-01-10T07:30:00-06:00", "seats": 3, "pricePerSeat": 25 }

### 15. Publish a ride with a MODIFIED token  -> 401 "Invalid token"
POST {{base}}/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}x

{ "origin": { "name": "Plaza de Armas", "lat": 20.5931, "lng": -100.3896 }, "destination": "Main campus", "departureTime": "2030-01-10T07:30:00-06:00", "seats": 3, "pricePerSeat": 25 }

### 16. Publish a ride (protected) -> 201 + Location header + weather from Open-Meteo
### Change departureTime to a date within the next 15 days to get a real forecast;
### dates further away return weather.status = "unavailable" (the ride is still created).
# @name newRide
POST {{base}}/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

{ "origin": { "name": "Jardín Guerrero", "lat": 20.5925, "lng": -100.3938 }, "destination": "Main campus", "departureTime": "2030-01-10T07:30:00-06:00", "seats": 3, "pricePerSeat": 20 }

### 17. Publish a ride with invalid data  -> 400 with one detail per field
POST {{base}}/rides
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

{ "origin": { "name": "X", "lat": 200 }, "destination": "", "departureTime": "yesterday", "seats": 10, "pricePerSeat": -5 }

### 18. Live forecast for ride 1 (third-party API)  -> 200, or 503 WEATHER_UNAVAILABLE if Open-Meteo fails
GET {{base}}/rides/1/weather

### 19. Book a seat as Luis (protected)  -> 201
POST {{base}}/rides/1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{luisToken}}

### 20. Book the same ride again  -> 409 "You already have a seat in this ride"
POST {{base}}/rides/1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{luisToken}}

### 21. Driver books own ride  -> 409
POST {{base}}/rides/1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### 22. My bookings (protected)  -> 200 [ ... ]
GET {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{luisToken}}

### 23. Luis tries to cancel Ana's ride  -> 403
DELETE {{base}}/rides/1
Authorization: Bearer {{luisToken}}

### 24. Ana cancels her ride  -> 204 (no body)
DELETE {{base}}/rides/{{newRide.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### 25. Unknown route  -> 404
GET {{base}}/drivers
